  "90 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 26 min of vigorous work a week. Some muscle soreness is expected; joint pain is not. Still sore after 48 hours? Repeat sessions before moving up.": "90 minit Zon 2 yang dijadualkan dan kira-kira 26 minit kerja bersungguh-sungguh seminggu. Sesetengah kesakitan otot dijangka; sakit sendi tidak. Masih sakit selepas 48 jam? Ulangi sesi sebelum bergerak ke atas.",
