  "Animation styles (a test): nine ways to draw the exercise animation, for now only on Zone 2 (\"Easy step-ups or marching\"); every other exercise keeps the mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) and Voxel are three.js scenes; Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) and ASCII (text) are drawn without three.js. All of them play the same movement.": "Gaya animasi (ujian): sembilan cara untuk melukis animasi latihan, buat masa ini hanya pada Zon 2 (\"Langkah naik atau kawad mudah\"); setiap senaman lain menyimpan peragawati. Mannequin, Atlet (separa realistik), Anime (berlorek sel), Poli rendah, Kartun (garis dakwat) dan Voxel ialah adegan three.js; Piktogram (SVG), Berus dakwat (kanvas 2D) dan ASCII (teks) dilukis tanpa tiga.js. Kesemua mereka memainkan pergerakan yang sama.",
