  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Pada tahap yang lebih mudah, bergerak perlahan-lahan sehingga anda mempelajari pergerakan itu.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Sekurang-kurangnya 120 minit Zon 2 yang dijadualkan dan kira-kira 51 minit kardio keras seminggu; mengawal blok kuat pada hari Selasa, Khamis dan Sabtu.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, kekalkan rentak yang pantas dan di bawah usaha habis-habisan. At Active, bekerja keras. At Well trained, gunakan usaha habis-habisan.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, pegang dumbbell di setiap tangan, atau gelungkan pita di pinggang anda dengan sauhnya di hadapan anda. Band harus menarik anda ke hadapan, seperti kereta luncur.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, tolak ke atas dengan tangan anda. At higher levels, tarik diri anda ke belakang dengan hamstring anda.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Pada penghujung selang terakhir anda, perhatikan kadar denyutan puncak anda. Berjalan perlahan-lahan selama 60 saat dan perhatikan kadar denyutan jantung anda sekali lagi. Masukkan penurunan (puncak tolak bacaan 60s).",
