  "Bryan: seated calf raises 1 × 25. The standing single-leg version adds Achilles preparation for jumping, his own 2026 concern.": "Bryan: betis duduk menaikkan 1 × 25. Versi kaki tunggal berdiri menambah persediaan Achilles untuk melompat, kebimbangannya sendiri pada tahun 2026.",
  "Bryan: to fatigue, 2×/wk": "Bryan: untuk keletihan, 2×/minggu",
  "Bryan’s 2025 Galpin session includes these in the speed and power block (2 × 5). You need about 2 m of clear floor to move sideways.": "Sesi Galpin 2025 Bryan termasuk ini dalam blok kelajuan dan kuasa (2 × 5). Anda memerlukan kira-kira 2 m lantai yang jelas untuk bergerak ke sisi.",
  "Bryan’s 2025 session has a rotational power slot (2 × 5), and his Bone Density protocol lists medicine-ball throws. Use a fast band chop at home.": "Sesi 2025 Bryan mempunyai slot kuasa putaran (2 × 5), dan protokol Ketumpatan Tulangnya menyenaraikan balingan bola ubat. Gunakan band chop pantas di rumah.",
  "Bryan’s 2026 dunk training is built on heavy pulls (a 385 lb, about 175 kg, PR on 4 Sep 2026, followed straight away by jumps), and his bone protocol names deadlifts. The dumbbell Romanian deadlift provides the heavy hip-hinge work in this plan.": "Latihan dunk 2026 Bryan dibina berdasarkan tarikan berat (385 lb, kira-kira 175 kg, PR pada 4 Sep 2026, diikuti terus dengan lompatan), dan protokol tulangnya menamakan deadlift. Dumbbell Romanian deadlift menyediakan kerja engsel pinggul yang berat dalam pelan ini.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026) puts jumping and hopping into the warm-up 4–7 times a week. He mentions stiff tendons and Achilles risk in his 2026 dunk training notes. This plan gives the tendons a small daily dose of work.": "Protokol Ketumpatan Tulang Bryan (Apr 2026) meletakkan lompat dan lompat ke dalam memanaskan badan 4–7 kali seminggu. Dia menyebut tendon kaku dan risiko Achilles dalam nota latihan 2026 dunknya. Pelan ini memberikan tendon sedikit kerja harian.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026): high ground-reaction shockwaves stimulate osteoblast mineral deposition to maintain 99th percentile bone density.": "Protokol Ketumpatan Tulang Bryan (Apr 2026): gelombang kejutan tindak balas tanah yang tinggi merangsang pemendapan mineral osteoblas untuk mengekalkan ketumpatan tulang persentil ke-99.",
  "Bryan’s Friday session in his newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026) includes step-ups at 3 × 10 per leg. His bone protocol also uses box step-ups for power training.": "Sesi Jumaat Bryan dalam templat mingguan terbarunya (surat berita senaman, 4 Okt 2026) termasuk peningkatan pada 3 × 10 setiap kaki. Protokol tulangnya juga menggunakan langkah kotak untuk latihan kuasa.",
  "Bryan’s Friday template: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-ups and side planks. Start with power work in Galpin’s order, then use Bryan’s 2026 pairing of heavy hip hinges followed by jumps.": "Templat Jumaat Bryan: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-up dan papan sisi. Mulakan dengan kerja berkuasa mengikut tertib Galpin, kemudian gunakan gandingan engsel pinggul berat Bryan 2026 diikuti dengan lompatan.",
  "Bryan’s guide says holding good posture uses muscles that may feel sore at first. Sharp pain, tingling or headaches are reasons to stop and get checked.": "Panduan Bryan mengatakan memegang postur yang baik menggunakan otot yang mungkin terasa sakit pada mulanya. Sakit yang tajam, kesemutan atau sakit kepala adalah sebab untuk berhenti dan diperiksa.",
  "Bryan's gym exercise": "Senaman gim Bryan",
  "Bryan’s mobility and strength exercises, including pulling, Knees-Over-Toes work and high-rep arm work, followed by Zone 2 toward his weekly target. This is the first of two posture strength days.": "Latihan mobiliti dan kekuatan Bryan, termasuk menarik, kerja Lutut-Over-Toes dan kerja lengan tinggi, diikuti oleh Zon 2 ke arah sasaran mingguannya. Ini adalah yang pertama daripada dua hari kekuatan postur.",
  "Bryan’s official light day: 20–30 min of gentle yoga or stretching.": "Hari terang rasmi Bryan: 20–30 minit yoga atau regangan lembut.",
  "Bryan’s official list: arm circles, wall slides, thread the needle, hip CARs.": "Senarai rasmi Bryan: bulatan lengan, gelongsor dinding, benang jarum, KERETA pinggul.",
  "Bryan’s official protocol includes both versions in its stability exercises: the single-leg RDL and single-leg toe touch.": "Protokol rasmi Bryan termasuk kedua-dua versi dalam latihan kestabilannya: RDL kaki tunggal dan sentuhan jari kaki tunggal.",
  "Bryan’s official warm-up uses arm circles, leg swings, high knees and lateral lunges. Hip CARs and the lunge with twist come from his mobility day and his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin.": "Memanaskan badan rasmi Bryan menggunakan bulatan lengan, hayunan kaki, lutut tinggi dan lunges sisi. Hip CARs dan lunge with twist datang dari hari mobilitinya dan pemanasan badan 2025 bersama Dr. Andy Galpin.",
  "Bryan’s official yoga block includes cat-cow, cobbler’s pose, tree pose and cobra. Stay longer when you have time; his version lasts 15 min.": "Blok yoga rasmi Bryan termasuk kucing-lembu, pose tukang kasut, pose pokok dan ular tedung. Tinggal lebih lama apabila anda mempunyai masa; versi beliau berlangsung 15 min.",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #1. Official wording (2026): “With weights in your hands, bring your shoulders up and out. Keep your elbows back. Do 1 set to fatigue 2 times a week.” He uses about 9 kg (20 lb); his posture coach’s patients usually start near 3.5 kg (8 lb).": "Latihan ahli terapi fizikal Bryan #1. Perkataan rasmi (2026): \"Dengan beban di tangan anda, angkat bahu anda ke atas dan ke luar. Simpan siku anda ke belakang. Lakukan 1 set untuk keletihan 2 kali seminggu.\" Dia menggunakan kira-kira 9 kg (20 lb); pesakit postur jurulatihnya biasanya bermula hampir 3.5 kg (8 lb).",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #2. Official wording (2026): “With a hand on your forehead, resist the pressure of your hand pushing your head back. When doing this, be very patient.” He does it to fatigue twice a week.": "Latihan ahli terapi fizikal Bryan #2. Perkataan rasmi (2026): \"Dengan tangan di dahi anda, tahan tekanan tangan anda menolak kepala anda ke belakang. Apabila melakukan ini, bersabarlah.\" Dia melakukannya untuk keletihan dua kali seminggu.",
  "Bryan’s posture coach walks him through the neck and shoulder exercises.": "Jurulatih postur Bryan membimbingnya melalui latihan leher dan bahu.",
  "Bryan's protocol and home alternatives": "Protokol Bryan dan alternatif rumah",
  "Bryan’s protocol: at least 150 min a week of moderate activity (Zone 2) during which you can hold a conversation.": "Protokol Bryan: sekurang-kurangnya 150 minit seminggu melakukan aktiviti sederhana (Zon 2) di mana anda boleh mengadakan perbualan.",
  "Bryan's protocol: mechanical shock signals osteoblasts to deposit minerals. Keep knees slightly soft to protect cartilage while the bone absorbs the force.": "Protokol Bryan: kejutan mekanikal memberi isyarat kepada osteoblas untuk mendepositkan mineral. Pastikan lutut sedikit lembut untuk melindungi rawan sementara tulang menyerap daya.",
  "Bryan’s published options for bodyweight HIIT: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees without the push-up, jump squats, plus marching and bodyweight squats for beginners.": "Pilihan yang diterbitkan oleh Bryan untuk HIIT berat badan: bicu lompat, lutut tinggi, pendaki gunung, burpe tanpa tekan tubi, lompat jongkong, serta jongkong kawad dan berat badan untuk pemula.",
  "Bryan's rule: injury prevention comes first. Swap to the easier variant whenever a joint complains; never train through sharp pain.": "Peraturan Bryan: pencegahan kecederaan diutamakan. Tukar kepada varian yang lebih mudah bila-bila masa sendi mengadu; tidak pernah berlatih melalui kesakitan yang tajam.",
  "Bryan's video or post": "Video atau siaran Bryan",
  "Bryan's weekly targets card in Activity → This week: strength, Zone 2, hard cardio, jumps, balance, mobility and posture.": "Kad sasaran mingguan Bryan dalam Aktiviti → Minggu ini: kekuatan, Zon 2, kardio keras, lompatan, imbangan, mobiliti dan postur.",
