  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "Hari kekuatan mengambil asas templat (mencangkung, tekan tubi, berbaris, hayunan, lunge, tekan, naikkan, bawa, papan) dan tambahkan tanda tangan Knees-Over-Toes dan postur tinggi.",
  "Strength includes lunges, overhead and floor presses, step-ups, swings and carries alongside his signature exercises.": "Kekuatan termasuk lunges, overhed dan tekanan lantai, step-up, hayunan dan bawa bersama latihan khasnya.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri with progressive overload, short intervals Tue, Norwegian 4×4 Thu (start with 2–3 rounds, hard but controlled), easy outdoor or social activity Sat, recovery Sun. At least 150 min Zone 2 and 75 min hard cardio, about 10 of them near max.": "Kekuatan Isn/Rabu/Jum dengan lebihan progresif, selang pendek Sel, Norway 4×4 Kha (bermula dengan 2–3 pusingan, keras tetapi terkawal), aktiviti luar atau sosial yang mudah Sabtu, pemulihan Ahad. Sekurang-kurangnya 150 minit Zon 2 dan 75 minit kardio keras, kira-kira 10 daripadanya menghampiri maks.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri, short intervals Tue and Norwegian 4×4 Thu follow Bryan’s template. Saturday adds controlled vigorous work to the indoor Zone 2 session to meet his weekly totals.": "Kekuatan Isnin/Rabu/Jumaat, selang pendek Sel dan 4×4 Norway Kha mengikut templat Bryan. Sabtu menambah kerja kuat terkawal ke sesi dalaman Zon 2 untuk memenuhi jumlah mingguannya.",
