  "Train anyway": "Berlatih pula",
  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Latih kekuatan pada hari Isnin, Rabu dan Jumaat, lakukan selang pendek pada hari Selasa dan 4×4 Norway pada hari Khamis, kemudian kardio campuran pada hari Sabtu. Rehat pada hari Ahad. Zon 2 dan blok kuat terkawal membina ke arah sasaran kardio mingguan Bryan Johnson. Protokol awamnya disesuaikan di sini untuk berat badan, dumbbell boleh laras, bar tarik ke atas dan jalur.",
  "Trained": "Terlatih",
