  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Selasa: Selang 1 · letusan 20 saat + Zon 2 + belakang & teras",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Selasa: dua blok 8 × 20 s habis-habisan. Khamis: 4×4 Norway penuh di {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Selasa: dua blok 8 × 20 s habis-habisan. Khamis: 4×4 Norway penuh pada 159–178 bpm.",
